- No run in a real client yet.

Model/harness: Claude Opus 5.5 / Claude Code

Port to 0085217d1b: SidebarThreadRow.tsx follows upstream ea3328c50c (#42671, one shared tooltip serves every trigger): the Pin thread button is a SharedTooltipTrigger with its label instead of Tooltip, TooltipTrigger and TooltipPopup, like upstream's Unpin button beside it. Sidebar.tsx conflicted only in context. The change itself is unchanged.

Port to 4c8a324e8f: upstream a03c43363b (#43206) folded the Pin and reorder threads section of docs/user/thread-sidebar.md into the Pin and reorder bullet; that bullet now names the hover pin button beside the thread menu. Code unchanged.
